{"availability":"available","full":"mibrahim0603/Fraud-Detection-Project","name":"Fraud-Detection-Project","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-18T11:18:06Z","updated":"2026-10-10T16:40:41Z","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://fraud-detection-project-hurba2b9rwbrdtg73xvpbb.streamlit.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T19:02:52.811Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T19:02:52.811Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T19:02:52.811Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T19:02:52.811Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A full-stack financial fraud detection application using Random Forest + XGBoost ensemble + GraphSAGE GNN trained on the AIML Dataset (6.3M transactions). Features a Flask REST API, a Streamlit dashboard with SHAP explainability and fraud ring visualisation.","Research Paper: Hybrid Fraud Detection: Ensemble Classification and Graph Neural Networks for Transaction and Ring-Based Fraud Identification (draft, MJCET)","Honest evaluation note: The GNN previously reported F1=0.991 due to two compounding issues — label-leaking features (fraudsent/fraudrecv) and no train/test split. Both are now fixed: leaking features removed, ring-based split applied, metrics evaluated on held-out rings only. Honest GNN overall test: ROC-AUC 0.6971 · Avg-Precision 0.6212 · Precision 67.7% · Recall 42.9% · F1 0.525."],"features":["⚠️ Full and Error-removed include tainted balance columns — see Data Leakage Disclosure above.","StratifiedKFold(nsplits=5, shuffle=True, randomstate=42) · SMOTE inside each fold · models: LogReg, SVC, DecisionTree, RandomForest, XGBoost · no ensemble (CV does not save combined weights).","Graph built from 500 fraud + 1,000 normal transactions. Ring-based split: 2,396 train nodes, 597 test nodes.","¹ ROC-AUC undefined — all 8 ring-account test nodes are fraud (single class). Precision=1.0 means every ring-account flagged was a true positive; low recall reflects small, sparse ring clusters.","A node is labelled fraud if it sent or received any fraudulent transaction (not necessarily the originator)."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mibrahim0603/Fraud-Detection-Project/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"99e11cd5f4069a05a01557ee6bf88f69f7a5f5be0c460c04aeb1de41b7b15d77","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T19:02:52.893Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T19:02:52.893Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A full-stack financial fraud detection application using Random Forest + XGBoost ensemble + GraphSAGE GNN trained on the AIML Dataset (6.3M transactions). Features a Flask REST API, a Streamlit dashboard with SHAP explainability and fraud ring visualisation.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mibrahim0603/Fraud-Detection-Project/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"99e11cd5f4069a05a01557ee6bf88f69f7a5f5be0c460c04aeb1de41b7b15d77","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mibrahim0603/Fraud-Detection-Project/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T19:02:52.894Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T16:40:41Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/mibrahim0603/Fraud-Detection-Project/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T19:02:52.895Z","hash":"99e11cd5f4069a05a01557ee6bf88f69f7a5f5be0c460c04aeb1de41b7b15d77","originalBytes":16327,"storedBytes":16327,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["fraud","gnn","leakage","graph","api","features","nodes","precision","test","recall","xgboost","feature","roc-auc","data","rings","model","models","random","split","transaction","amount","metrics","strict","only","set","shap","svc","train","decisiontree","error-removed","fold","full","kfold","node","oldbalanceorg","randomforest","training","backend","bash","ensemble","get","logisticregression","note","oldbalancedest","rows","columns","dataset","detection","metrics.json"